/bin/
/dist/
.env

# The bot's own state: account directory (private keys), media, outbox,
# control socket. Never committed, and named here rather than only in
# .dockerignore because a stray `git add -A` is the likelier accident.
/data/

# Developer-local link to a freizone-server working tree. Deliberately not
# committed: CI and the Docker build must resolve pkg/client from a tagged
# module, and a checked-in workspace would silently build against whatever
# branch happens to sit next door -- the trap freizone-app's replace
# directive already has.
go.work
go.work.sum

